{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "03106",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 0.93,
      "end_seconds": 3.46,
      "duration_seconds": 2.53,
      "text": "Good morning, grab a seat."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 4.15,
      "end_seconds": 7.11,
      "duration_seconds": 2.96,
      "text": "Hello. I hope I'm not late."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 7.84,
      "end_seconds": 10.44,
      "duration_seconds": 2.6,
      "text": "What do you need help with?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 11.57,
      "end_seconds": 15.56,
      "duration_seconds": 3.99,
      "text": "So the thing is, I've got a limp."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 19.44,
      "end_seconds": 21.94,
      "duration_seconds": 2.5,
      "text": "Tell me your medicines, please."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 23.84,
      "end_seconds": 27.41,
      "duration_seconds": 3.57,
      "text": "Naproxen, 250 milligrams, twice a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 32.14,
      "end_seconds": 35.22,
      "duration_seconds": 3.08,
      "text": "What's the timeline, when did it begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 35.91,
      "end_seconds": 40.21,
      "duration_seconds": 4.3,
      "text": "Uh, uh, I've had it since Monday."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 42.08,
      "end_seconds": 45.29,
      "duration_seconds": 3.21,
      "text": "How strong would you say it is?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 46.86,
      "end_seconds": 52.08,
      "duration_seconds": 5.22,
      "text": "So, maybe a four out of ten on a bad day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 57.44,
      "end_seconds": 60.37,
      "duration_seconds": 2.93,
      "text": "Any stiffness putting on socks as well?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 64.63,
      "end_seconds": 75.5,
      "duration_seconds": 10.87,
      "text": "Yes, about the same, ten days. Yeah, as for stiffness putting on socks, mild, I'd say. It just comes and goes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 75.7,
      "end_seconds": 77.26,
      "duration_seconds": 1.56,
      "text": "Okay, go on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 79.08,
      "end_seconds": 89.75,
      "duration_seconds": 10.67,
      "text": "Erm, there's night pain as well. As for night pain, it feels severe to me. It's a couple of times a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 100.79,
      "end_seconds": 105.27,
      "duration_seconds": 4.48,
      "text": "So, did you get fever, weight loss or numbness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 106.64,
      "end_seconds": 111.69,
      "duration_seconds": 5.05,
      "text": "Okay, so no, no fever, weight loss or numbness."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 113.6,
      "end_seconds": 115.73,
      "duration_seconds": 2.13,
      "text": "Did you notice any fall?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 116.88,
      "end_seconds": 118.7,
      "duration_seconds": 1.82,
      "text": "Nope, no fall."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 120.45,
      "end_seconds": 123.73,
      "duration_seconds": 3.28,
      "text": "How about your heart, any problems like that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 125.03,
      "end_seconds": 126.99,
      "duration_seconds": 1.96,
      "text": "No, that's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 134.05,
      "end_seconds": 136.79,
      "duration_seconds": 2.74,
      "text": "Before we go further, any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 137.38,
      "end_seconds": 144.82,
      "duration_seconds": 7.44,
      "text": "So, uh, not currently, but as a youngster trimethoprim gave me a rash."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 146.21,
      "end_seconds": 147.02,
      "duration_seconds": 0.81,
      "text": "Any smoking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 148.91,
      "end_seconds": 152.97,
      "duration_seconds": 4.06,
      "text": "No, I've never smoked in my life."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 155.0,
      "end_seconds": 156.67,
      "duration_seconds": 1.67,
      "text": "And alcohol, how much?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 157.91,
      "end_seconds": 163.44,
      "duration_seconds": 5.53,
      "text": "I used to drink heavily but I stopped four years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 165.33,
      "end_seconds": 168.12,
      "duration_seconds": 2.79,
      "text": "Do you follow any particular diet?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 168.63,
      "end_seconds": 172.59,
      "duration_seconds": 3.96,
      "text": "I'm vegetarian and have been for years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 174.24,
      "end_seconds": 177.41,
      "duration_seconds": 3.17,
      "text": "Right, do you work outside the home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 179.32,
      "end_seconds": 183.14,
      "duration_seconds": 3.82,
      "text": "I'm a hairdresser, on my feet all day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 184.04,
      "end_seconds": 187.65,
      "duration_seconds": 3.61,
      "text": "Okay, are you on your own at home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 189.56,
      "end_seconds": 192.44,
      "duration_seconds": 2.88,
      "text": "I live with my elderly mother."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 194.25,
      "end_seconds": 197.45,
      "duration_seconds": 3.2,
      "text": "Has anyone ever diagnosed you with something?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 199.98,
      "end_seconds": 205.85,
      "duration_seconds": 5.87,
      "text": "I, I have arthritis in my knees, for nearly five years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 210.45,
      "end_seconds": 218.82,
      "duration_seconds": 8.37,
      "text": "Okay, I can see arthritis in your knees in your file as well. Anything surgical in your history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 219.81,
      "end_seconds": 224.94,
      "duration_seconds": 5.13,
      "text": "I mean, I had a varicose vein procedure last year."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 226.0,
      "end_seconds": 229.31,
      "duration_seconds": 3.31,
      "text": "I'll note down your vital signs first."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 235.89,
      "end_seconds": 238.4,
      "duration_seconds": 2.51,
      "text": "That's it, just a little longer..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 259.9,
      "end_seconds": 266.1,
      "duration_seconds": 6.2,
      "text": "Okay: oxygen saturation is 99 percent, BP is 122 over 75, heart rate 71."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 267.42,
      "end_seconds": 269.38,
      "duration_seconds": 1.96,
      "text": "May I examine you now?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 271.08,
      "end_seconds": 273.69,
      "duration_seconds": 2.61,
      "text": "I'll listen to your chest now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 289.11,
      "end_seconds": 296.29,
      "duration_seconds": 7.18,
      "text": "Hip rotation is painful and limited and you have a limp favouring the right side."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 300.5,
      "end_seconds": 311.9,
      "duration_seconds": 11.4,
      "text": "Okay, that's the examination finished. So where does that leave us? I'm honestly not certain yet. It could be hip osteoarthritis, or it might be a back problem."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 312.69,
      "end_seconds": 316.04,
      "duration_seconds": 3.35,
      "text": "I'm scared it's something bad. Is it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 317.88,
      "end_seconds": 328.64,
      "duration_seconds": 10.76,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's hip osteoarthritis, and we'll know more once the an X-ray of the hips is back."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 340.17,
      "end_seconds": 348.35,
      "duration_seconds": 8.18,
      "text": "We should do an X-ray of the hips for hip pain. That's all from me. Any questions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 350.18,
      "end_seconds": 354.15,
      "duration_seconds": 3.97,
      "text": "Okay, that makes sense. Thanks for explaining."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 355.49,
      "end_seconds": 356.81,
      "duration_seconds": 1.32,
      "text": "Look after yourself."
    }
  ]
}